{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:14 2026-09-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:14 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:14 2026-09-13 HKT</p><p>大角咀奧海城二期Pizza食店「Dough Bros.」遭賊人爆竊。今日（13日）早上11時17分，職員返回店舖準備開門營業時，發現店內有現金和財物失竊，於是報案。現場是海庭道18號，警員到場調查，經點算後發現店內有大約2,100元現金、4部共值約8,000元的平板電腦，以及外賣袋被賊人偷去。</p><p>消息稱，閉路電視拍得賊人於今日凌晨4時許，潛入涉事餐廳爆竊。賊人犯案時身穿黑色衫褲，警方正追緝其歸案。</p><img alt=\"店員（右）向警方錄口供。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d32eba556a3c3bff276ae59823f240cb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"遇竊的Pizza店Dough Bros.。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/47c294abd06beb0db84ae9ba48c6e2e4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_21_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/456cb05c284121039f76713e80c3d463/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_21_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c8d139fdbad3096be3b6ee6cf1216f47/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bd6415469287aa73ebd1bfbd356b6f1b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e25430a204e2f2046789c399533674b3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"店員（左）向警方錄口供。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/13dcc28d878ac4ada0310d22fe770bb9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07ca0e4781cc1ebd0641ebbbade19ec6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是海庭道18號奧海城二期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c6e5dd0cc738565274df98cc3dc8b0f6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ab4937a52c7ee04ed030769555963187/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_22_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/966ac0552fc769dbf99e17cc14568272/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_13_45_22.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T06:38:35.110680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}